## 9. Pillar 5: Delivery System with Live Tracking

### Three-Way Real-Time System

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 👤 User
    participant S as 🏪 Shop
    participant A as 🚴 Delivery Agent
    participant Sys as ⚙️ LocalSampark System
    
    U->>Sys: Place order from Shop X
    Sys->>S: 🔔 New order notification
    S->>Sys: Accept order → Start preparing
    Sys->>Sys: Find nearest online agent (PostGIS query)
    Sys->>A: 🔔 Delivery request (₹35 payout, 2.1 km)
    A->>Sys: Accept delivery
    Sys->>U: "Agent Rahul 🚴 assigned" + Map opens
    
    Note over A,U: GPS tracking begins (5-sec intervals via WebSocket)
    
    A->>S: Arrives at shop (geofence auto-detects)
    Sys->>U: 📍 "Agent at shop"
    S->>A: Hand over package
    S->>Sys: Mark "Picked Up"
    Sys->>U: 📍 "Out for delivery" — ETA: 8 mins
    
    A->>U: Arrives at delivery location
    Sys->>U: 📍 "Agent has arrived"
    U->>A: Share OTP for verification
    A->>Sys: Enter OTP + Upload photo proof
    Sys->>U: ✅ "Delivered! Rate your experience ⭐"
    Sys->>A: 💰 ₹35 credited to wallet
```

### Delivery Lifecycle

```
📋 Pending → ✅ Confirmed → 🍳 Preparing → 📦 Ready
    → 🚴 Agent Assigned → 🏪 At Shop → 📤 Picked Up
    → 🛵 Out for Delivery → 🏠 Arrived → ✅ Delivered
    
❌ Cancelled (before "Picked Up" only)
```

| Feature | Description | Admin Control |
|---|---|---|
| **Tracking Mode** | Status-based (MVP) → Live GPS (Phase 2) | ✅ Admin toggles mode |
| **Fee Engine** | Base ₹20 + ₹8/km, max ₹80 | ✅ Admin sets all values |
| **Surge Pricing** | 1.5x during peak hours | ✅ Admin sets multiplier + hours |
| **Commission** | 15% platform cut | ✅ Admin sets percentage |
| **Geofence** | 100m radius for auto-status | ✅ Admin sets radius |
| **Scheduled Delivery** | Book for future time slots | ✅ Admin enables/disables |
| **Multi-Stop** | Agent picks from multiple shops | ✅ Admin enables/disables |
| **Agent Verification** | ID + Vehicle proof required | ✅ Admin sets requirements |

