## 10. Pillar 6: Admin Full Control System

### Admin Configuration Engine

Every app setting is stored in `admin_config` table and fetched by all platforms on launch. Admin changes take effect **instantly** across Website, Android, and iOS.

```sql
-- Admin controls EVERYTHING via this table
CREATE TABLE admin_config (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),
    config_key VARCHAR(200) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    config_value JSONB NOT NULL,
    config_category VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
    description TEXT,
    region_id UUID REFERENCES regions(id), -- NULL = global
    is_active BOOLEAN DEFAULT TRUE,
    updated_by UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    updated_at TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);
```

