## 15. Real-Time Communication

### WebSocket Events (All Platforms)

| Namespace | Event | Direction | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| `/chat` | `chat:message` | ↔ | Send/receive messages |
| `/chat` | `chat:typing` | ↔ | Typing indicator |
| `/chat` | `chat:read` | → Server | Read receipt |
| `/chat` | `chat:translated` | ← Server | Auto-translated message |
| `/delivery` | `delivery:location` | Agent → User | GPS coordinates (5s) |
| `/delivery` | `delivery:status` | Server → All | Milestone update |
| `/delivery` | `delivery:eta` | Server → User | ETA recalculation |
| `/feed` | `feed:new_post` | ← Server | New nearby post |
| `/feed` | `feed:vote` | ↔ | Live vote counts |
| `/feed` | `feed:comment` | ← Server | New comment |
| `/polls` | `poll:vote` | ↔ | Live poll results |
| `/sos` | `sos:alert` | ← Server | Emergency nearby |
| `/sos` | `sos:response` | → Server | Responding to SOS |
| `/config` | `config:update` | ← Server | Admin changed setting |
| `/carpool` | `carpool:live_trip` | ↔ | Live trip sharing |

