## 22. Risk Assessment

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| **Cold start** | Critical | Physical Dhanori onboarding: 50+ shops, 100+ users before launch |
| **Google Maps API costs** | High | Status-based tracking first; Mapbox/OSM fallback; cache routes |
| **Feature overload** | High | Phased rollout; feature flags; admin can toggle features on/off |
| **Multi-platform bugs** | High | Shared test suite; CI/CD for all platforms |
| **Payment compliance** | High | Razorpay (pre-compliant); auto-KYC for wallets |
| **Data privacy** | High | Proxy numbers; location obfuscation; encrypted document vault |
| **Agent reliability** | Medium | Rating system; instant payouts; leaderboard bonuses |
| **Competition** | Medium | Our moat: 85+ features combined; no competitor has this breadth |
| **Scaling beyond Dhanori** | Medium | Docker; horizontal scaling; upgrade path to AWS/GCP |
| **AI accuracy** | Medium | Human fallback for chatbot; admin override for recommendations |

